# Keep the compact, reproducible Phase 4 summaries used by the dashboard and
# reports. Large row-level detector matrices remain ignored.
#
# anomaly_investigation.csv is the exception to "keep it small": the
# dashboard reads it directly at startup, so it must stay tracked even
# though it is a few MB larger than the other summaries here.
